      "text": {
        "jp": "じゃなきゃ、こんなとこ来ないわよね。\r\nだって何もないんだもの。\r\n売店すらやってないなんて、驚きだわ。",
        "official_en": "Why else would you come to the absolute middle of nowhere like this? This station doesn’t even have a shop!",
        "real_en": "Why else would you come to a place like this? There's nothing here. Even the station shop isn't open!"
